      "writtenOn": "2019-04-02T15:14:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fun, this is one of the more elegant ways I figured out how to solve it :)\n\nThe issue lines in the the test task definitions (like pingpong) only use 4 variables in their task definitions like most boards.\n\nMinute-ia needed a 5th flag for each task, and we though we have everything covered before but somehow we missed this tests build target until now.\n\nI tried to keep this change to the most localized spot and not need to define this in each board file that uses minute-ia.\n\nI am open to suggestions.",
      "parentUuid": "1304afef_f0ffbd30",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 3
      },
      "revId": "1077dc2154ac7f02338e33d800b053542a2cbab5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "716366b5_94abf83e",
        "filename": "core/minute-ia/task.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 12,
      "author": {
        "id": 1330845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-02T16:23:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From a technical debt perspective, I think it would be better to do a find/replace across the tasklist files adding the extra parameter. While this is a clever way to solve the problem without refactoring the tasklists, it adds an unusual layer of complexity to defining tasks.",
      "parentUuid": "a5f490f1_44ebda03",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 3
      },
